  "whatsNew.gotIt": "Got it",
  "whatsNew.grokBody": "On OpenClaw, xAI Grok can be set up with an API key or a SuperGrok or X Premium sign-in. Changing the model, or switching Local AI on or off, no longer restarts the assistant in most cases, so the chat carries on.",
  "whatsNew.grokSummary": "On OpenClaw, set up xAI Grok with an API key or a SuperGrok or X Premium sign-in. Most model changes no longer restart the assistant.",
  "whatsNew.grokTitle": "xAI Grok, and model changes without a restart",
  "whatsNew.highlightsLabel": "Highlights of ClawBox 4.3",
  "whatsNew.holdToTalkBody": "Hold the chat's microphone button, or F8, while you speak, and let go to send. Spoken replies download several times smaller, and Settings → Voice can play every reply aloud, including replies to questions you typed.",
