  "whatsNew.previousScreenshot": "Previous screenshot",
  "whatsNew.primeRadiantBody": "A new app that keeps a wiki for you. Point it at your documents and it writes a page for each one, listing the facts it found with where each came from and how sure it is. Every night it tidies the wiki, looks for facts that contradict each other, and asks you about anything it cannot settle alone.",
