  "whatsNew.primeRadiantTitle": "Prime Radiant, a living wiki",
  "whatsNew.publicLinksBody": "Right-click an app the Coding Agent built and choose Create public link. Visitors reach only that app, for a set time or until you disable the link, and you can ask them for a password.",
  "whatsNew.publicLinksSummary": "Right-click an app the Coding Agent built and choose Create public link, for a set time and with an optional password.",
  "whatsNew.publicLinksTitle": "Share an app with a public link",
  "whatsNew.readMore": "Read what's new in 4.3",
  "whatsNew.screenshotBody": "The new Screenshot app captures the whole screen, an area or one window, and lets you mark the picture up before it is saved to the Screenshots folder in Files. Print Screen, Ctrl+Shift+S or the Screenshot button beside the clock takes one in a single step.",
  "whatsNew.screenshotSummary": "Capture the whole screen, an area or a window. Print Screen or Ctrl+Shift+S.",
